# A centred input forms two images at 3 L_pi / 8, with L_pi = 92.70 um from the two lowest modes of the body.
# Reference: equal outputs by symmetry; near the imaging length each carries almost half.
title 1x2 multimode interferometer 6 um wide at 1.1 of the imaging length
reference 2.8
grid dx=0.02 dz=0.25
window width=16 length=63.25
guide straight x=0 width=1.2 from=0 to=10
guide straight x=0 width=6 from=10 to=48.25
guide straight x=1.5 width=1.2 from=48.25 to=63.25
guide straight x=-1.5 width=1.2 from=48.25 to=63.25
launch mode x=0 width=1.2
monitor upper z=63.25 x=1.5 width=1.2
monitor lower z=63.25 x=-1.5 width=1.2
plane end z=63.25
expect power upper 0.308522999 2e-7
expect power lower 0.308522999 2e-7
expect total end 0.993021496 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 5.2332671 2e-6
expect neff 2.578655314 2e-8
expect ratio upper lower 1.0 1e-4
